## ✅ Verified Results

- All three routers show **FULL** OSPF neighbor state with consistent DR/BDR roles across all three /30 links.
- `show ip route ospf` on each router shows the LAN subnets of **both** other 
sites (not just directly connected neighbors) — confirming full-mesh route propagation.
- End-to-end ping test from a PC on Site A successfully reached a PC on Site B, confirming full
Layer 3 connectivity across the OSPF domain.

